<title>USA: TJX sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>TJX sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Ma 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apparel retailer TJX Cos Inc said Wednesday its board had approved a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The split will take the form of a 100-percent stock dividend to be paid on June 26 to shareholders of record as of June 11.  </p>
<p>The board approved an increase in the regular quarterly dividend to $0.10 a share from $0.07, which would become $0.05 a share on each post-split share.</p>
<p>TJX has more than 77 million shares in circulation.</p>
</text>
